==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Bourbon, a county in US State of Kentucky.

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɜː(r)bən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[whiskey]] [[distill|distilled]] from a mixture of grains in which more than half is [[maize]], aged in [[oak]] [[barrel|barrels]]. Made chiefly in the United States.
#: ''Vahag likes '''bourbon'''. Vahag likes scotch more. Vahag also likes furry animals.''
# A serving of bourbon.
# A [[Bourbon biscuit]].

